<title>LATVIA: LATVIA-UNIBANKA HIGHER AMID MIXED MARKET.</title>
<headline>LATVIA-UNIBANKA HIGHER AMID MIXED MARKET.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
